        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia #10 Safety Stainless Steel Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia #10 Stainless Steel Lever features a very simple, clean, business-like design. The curved lever is easy to hold, adding an additional safety element to this ADA compliant door lever, making in a great choice for commercial applications where children are present such as child daycare centers. Easy to install, this is a long lasting stainless steel door lever for residential and commercial doors use. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-54620-SM.jpg?v=1704354652\" width=\"390\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\" alt=\"OMN 10 Lever Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Light Commercial Stainless Steel Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Residential and Commercial Doors</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia  #10 Stainless Steel Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Diameter (thickness): 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction </li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Safety  Stainless Steel Door Lever Set, Omnia  #10",
                "description": "Omnia #10 Stainless Steel Lever - The Omnia #10 Stainless Steel Lever features a very simple, clean, business-like design. The curved lever is easy to hold, adding an additional safety element to this ADA compliant door lever, making in a great choice for commercial applications where children are present such as child daycare centers. Easy to install, this is a long lasting stainless steel door lever for residential and commercial doors use. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Omnia  #10 Stainless Steel Levers, Omnia Number 10 Stainless Steel, OMN-10 Stainless Steel Leverset,  commercial  Stainless Steel Leversets,  Omnia  #10 stainless levers, safety stainless steel handle  lever set, child daycare  centers  door hardware, stainless door locks, safe commercial stainless steel locks, omnia door hardware, ada approved door levers,  return to door levers,"
